<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1601444702 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">30 Sep 2020 05:45</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<div class="content-panel standalone series">
<div style="text-align: right;">
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;评分</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;评分</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/short-stories:00031/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>2020/3/1，“花”</p>
<hr />
<p>总是咧着嘴笑的柴郡猫其实也会有烦心事。</p>
<p>对于Dr.Alto Clef来说，<br />
最糟糕的东西莫过于空了的薄荷糖罐，走音的尤克里里，以及，<span style="font-size:105%;">一条必将被重启的世界线</span>。</p>
<hr />
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;评论区&nbsp;1个</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;评论区</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p><strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drcore" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6414984); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6414984&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609921907" alt="DrCore" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6414984)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drcore" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6414984); return false;">DrCore</a></span>：</strong>↑算是读完了<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/yesterday">Yesterday</a>之后的脑洞。<br />
基金会就真就没有快乐呗，<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">看开了，我已经不求HE了(´д⊂)</span><br />
无论怎么重启世界，依旧阻止不了必定发生的事，挽救不了必须死的人，真是&#8230;充满了无可奈何的宿命感<br />
他<em>只</em>是基金会最趁手的枪</p>
</blockquote>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00031" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/short-stories:00031" target="_blank">编辑 &amp; 评论</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00031-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drcore" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6414984); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6414984&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609921907" alt="DrCore" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6414984)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drcore" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6414984); return false;">DrCore</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1592627648 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">20 Jun 2020 04:34</span></p>
</div>
