<p><span id="u-credit-00092" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/short-stories:00092" target="_blank">编辑 &amp; 评论</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00092-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-ful" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4959716); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4959716&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609921908" alt="Dr Ful" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4959716)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-ful" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4959716); return false;">Dr Ful</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1601815760 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">04 Oct 2020 12:49</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<div class="content-panel standalone series">
<div style="text-align: right;">
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;评分</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;评分</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/short-stories:00026/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>20██/██/██ ██:██, 地点：██████</p>
<hr />
<p>2077年，随着生物技术的发展，很多名人的脑细胞都被拿出来拍卖。</p>
<p>一名基金会特工在标价区看到霍金的脑细胞标价是10万美元，爱因斯坦的是20万美元，而伦理道德委员会的仲裁员的是100万美元。</p>
<p>“为什么这些仲裁员的脑细胞价格这么贵？”</p>
<p>“因为它们都是没用过的，先生，是全新的！”</p>
<hr />
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;评论区&nbsp;2个</a></div>
