<blockquote>
<p><strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drcore" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6414984); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6414984&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609921908" alt="DrCore" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6414984)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drcore" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6414984); return false;">DrCore</a></span>：</strong>建议投到<em>基金会政治笑话</em>，另外，这个点子总有种似曾相识之感</p>
